    "api_info" : {
      "title" : "List Models",
      "description" : "Retrieves a list of all available language models (LLMs) configured in the system. This operation provides model details that can be used for agent creation, configuration, and selection of appropriate AI capabilities.\n\nInput Parameters:\nNone\n\nOutput Parameters:\nLLMs (array): List of available models, where each item contains:\nmodelName (string): Name of the model.\nLLMKey (string): Unique key identifying the model configuration.\nbaseUrl (string): Endpoint URL associated with the model.\ntemperature (number): Sampling temperature controlling randomness of responses.\nname (string): Display name of the model."
    },
